OL,3,GNEWSAWhat video footage tells us about
OL,4,ARAF training jet crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RAF is investigating a crash
OL,7,Finvolving one of its high-speed Hawk
OL,8,Ffighter jets after two of its pilots
OL,9,Fejected and parachuted from their plane
OL,10,Fmoments before it hit the ground,
OL,11,Fbursting into flames.
OL,13,FThe RAF said training on these sorts of
OL,14,Fjets had been "temporarily" paused as a
OL,15,F"precautionary measure".
OL,17,FNorth Wales Police said the pilots, who
OL,18,Fhad been flying a training aircraft,
OL,19,Fwere being treated for minor injuries.
OL,20,FBoth were doing well and were expected
OL,21,Fto make a "full recovery", the RAF said
OL,22,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
